//
// Host-only gate for the registry's markdown-vs-JSON mirror: every per-method
// table row must carry that method's tile, throughput, mean_rel_L1 and herd
// from the JSON that calls itself the source of truth (review of #77). No
// device, no downloads, and no ml_dtypes -- this one is stdlib only.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_registry_tables.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: PASS  test_every_markdown_row_matches_its_own_methods_json_entry
// CHECK: PASS  test_no_table_row_has_gone_missing
// CHECK: registry table tests: 2/2 passed
